From: Chase Payne <chase_payne@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 15 Aug 2026 22:36:54 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] feat(display): support live remote mode changes

Remote Duo seats need to follow client resolution changes without tearing down their monitor or restarting the IddCx driver.

Add a versioned mode-control request that updates monitor modes and display config in place, restores the prior configuration on failure, and exposes probe output for verification.

Cover protocol, client, dispatcher, state, diagnostics, and backend-failure behavior.

